# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
# Translation template for namtor-kde (KDE Plasma 6 KCM).
#
# This is a placeholder .pot file. Once xgettext is run against the
# POTFILES.in sources with the Qt parser, this file will contain the
# extracted msgids. For now, the structure exists so distro packagers
# can run `msginit -l <locale>` to seed per-locale .po files.
#
# KDE uses ki18n for i18n() in QML. The .po files are compiled to .mo
# (or .qm for Qt's own system) by the distro packaging (PKGBUILD / spec /
# debian rules), not by install-manifest.toml — locale files are a distro-
# packaging concern, not a per-file manifest entry.
#
# To regenerate:
#   xgettext --package-name=namtor-kde --package-version=0.1.0 \
#     --language=Qt --qt --from-code=UTF-8 \
#     -f packaging/po/kde/POTFILES.in -o packaging/po/kde/namtor-kde.pot
#
# To start a new locale:
#   msginit -i packaging/po/kde/namtor-kde.pot -l <locale> \
#     -o packaging/po/kde/<locale>.po
#
# Project-ID-Version: namtor-kde 0.1.0
# MIME-Version: 1.0
# Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
# Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit
